### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@acme.com",
  "password": "admin123!"
}

### Research company
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/research/company
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "acme.com"
}

### Get company
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/drafts/{{draftId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sync draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/crm/sync/{{draftId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}